WEBVTT

01:05.640 --> 01:07.720
A particular object's value

01:08.120 --> 01:09.600
is never the same as another object's.

01:11.000 --> 01:13.280
Value is not only based on the price,

01:13.760 --> 01:15.360
but also on a person's fondness for it...

01:15.520 --> 01:16.920
Can I see this one?

01:17.000 --> 01:18.120
This one?

01:20.040 --> 01:21.120
You have a good eye.

01:22.760 --> 01:24.000
Its details...

01:24.360 --> 01:26.080
Neil Armstrong wore it to the moon.

01:26.160 --> 01:28.440
And the story behind it.

01:28.840 --> 01:30.560
It first came out in 1969.

01:32.080 --> 01:33.280
It wasn't expensive then.

01:33.680 --> 01:35.520
It is now, though.
The price keeps going up.

01:38.760 --> 01:39.680
Thank you.

01:39.760 --> 01:41.520
I can give you a discount if you like it.

01:42.360 --> 01:43.560
You have a good eye.

01:44.880 --> 01:46.480
I'll come back to look at it later.

01:50.800 --> 01:52.880
But every object will have the same value

01:58.480 --> 01:59.920
once stolen.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.279
Is he not coming?

04:21.000 --> 04:22.800
My boss has some business abroad.

04:23.520 --> 04:25.200
He sent me on his behalf.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.080
This is TK,

04:28.880 --> 04:29.960
his son.

04:31.360 --> 04:33.440
-Hello.
-Hello.

04:37.960 --> 04:40.200
He was expelled for stealing.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.520
KEMAWITTAYANUSORN SCHOOL

04:41.600 --> 04:42.800
It's hard to believe.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.320
Some of the reports were exaggerated.

04:50.560 --> 04:53.360
We don't accept troublesome students,

04:53.880 --> 04:55.920
because we don't want any trouble
in our school.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.520
It causes a lot of problems.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.240
He is well aware of that,

05:01.840 --> 05:03.240
so he asked me to give you this.

05:10.400 --> 05:11.920
The school's maintenance fee.

05:12.000 --> 05:13.320
NARUECHIT LAORSRI
FIVE HUNDRED THOUSAND BAHT

05:13.880 --> 05:15.480
-Still--
-And this...

05:24.360 --> 05:25.360
is for you, Director.

05:29.440 --> 05:30.720
One million baht.

05:34.480 --> 05:37.040
Please tell him
that our school is very honored

05:37.120 --> 05:38.760
that he has entrusted his son to us.

05:39.880 --> 05:40.800
Certainly.

05:47.320 --> 05:49.080
You can go to class now, TK.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.400
Please excuse me.

06:11.200 --> 06:13.760
The survey that we conducted

06:13.840 --> 06:18.040
examined the time taken
to travel from home to school,

06:18.120 --> 06:20.280
for this class and the class next-door.

06:20.520 --> 06:23.000
We saw that each student
took a different amount of time.

06:23.080 --> 06:24.920
-Excuse me, ma'am.
-Yes.

06:29.440 --> 06:34.840
Everyone, a new student
will be joining us today.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.880
I'll let her introduce herself.

06:37.880 --> 06:40.880
Hello. I'm Nanno.

06:45.880 --> 06:47.440
Nice to meet you.

06:48.880 --> 06:51.160
Okay. You can sit
in that empty seat over there.

06:51.600 --> 06:52.480
Okay.

06:57.400 --> 06:59.080
All right. Let's continue with the lesson.

06:59.160 --> 07:02.040
We saw that each person
took a different amount of time, right?

07:02.120 --> 07:03.600
Some took five minutes. Some took ten.

07:03.680 --> 07:06.240
Some took half an hour,
and some took an hour and a half.

07:12.200 --> 07:13.160
Hey.

07:14.240 --> 07:16.360
Why is that guy...

07:18.120 --> 07:20.640
He's a problem child. His name is TK.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.680
He started here just before you did.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.560
Rumor has it

07:24.640 --> 07:27.200
that he was expelled
from his last school for stealing.

07:27.280 --> 07:28.360
Isn't that scary?

07:29.960 --> 07:30.920
Really?

07:31.760 --> 07:33.320
He doesn't look scary at all.

07:34.560 --> 07:36.880
I don't know. The only thing I know

07:36.960 --> 07:38.960
is that thieves are terrible.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.000
-Nid.
-Yes?

07:51.080 --> 07:52.880
Please take Nanno to lunch with you.

07:52.960 --> 07:53.800
Sure.

07:57.520 --> 07:59.560
Nanno, have you seen my eraser?

08:50.080 --> 08:51.360
I bought this for you.

08:59.840 --> 09:00.840
Take it.

09:03.280 --> 09:05.000
Did you buy or steal it?

09:06.720 --> 09:07.600
Listen.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.960
You are a very interesting person.

09:12.960 --> 09:13.960
How come?

09:14.840 --> 09:16.520
Are you afraid that I'll tell others

09:16.920 --> 09:18.640
that you're a thief, too?

09:20.520 --> 09:21.720
Come on.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.160
Why would I be afraid?

09:24.960 --> 09:28.320
No one would believe
a word you say anyway.

09:47.400 --> 09:48.280
Hey.

09:48.640 --> 09:50.040
Do you want to go to the moon?

09:52.160 --> 09:53.080
No.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.760
I just like that watch.

10:01.040 --> 10:02.440
Let me tell you something.

10:03.680 --> 10:05.440
Your method of stealing

10:06.240 --> 10:08.960
is old-fashioned and very risky.

10:10.360 --> 10:12.440
No wonder there are weird rumors
going around.

10:14.400 --> 10:15.640
Are you better than me?

10:17.040 --> 10:19.920
Do you want to know what I just stole?

10:23.160 --> 10:24.320
How would I know?

10:33.160 --> 10:34.040
This.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.640
KEMAWITTAYANUSORN SCHOOL

10:37.720 --> 10:38.920
It's more fun than I thought,

10:39.960 --> 10:42.160
stealing from the school.

10:45.640 --> 10:47.080
Shall we have a competition?

12:12.640 --> 12:16.280
Today, we will look at the results
from the exam you just took,

12:16.920 --> 12:17.880
and see whether...

12:46.280 --> 12:47.560
You're good.

12:48.560 --> 12:49.960
Do you believe me now?

12:52.280 --> 12:53.600
Have you ever been caught?

12:55.560 --> 12:57.800
No. I'm always careful.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.240
How about you?

13:00.280 --> 13:01.480
Never.

13:01.560 --> 13:02.400
Liar.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.560
You're really not cautious enough.

13:05.520 --> 13:06.680
But I can run fast.

13:08.360 --> 13:11.760
Stop right there, thieves!

13:11.840 --> 13:14.520
Come back here!

13:20.200 --> 13:21.360
Nanno.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.600
Do you believe that I'm fast now?

13:31.680 --> 13:32.640
Yes.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.120
Oh, no.

14:45.040 --> 14:48.160
SHALL WE GO AGAIN TODAY?

14:59.920 --> 15:02.360
SURE. BUT NO MORE RUNNING. IT'S TIRING.

15:20.160 --> 15:22.560
CALL ME MASTER AND I'LL TEACH YOU.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.760
YOU ARE ALL TALK.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.880
-YOU FOX!
-AND YOU SUCK.

15:41.960 --> 15:44.120
-GHOST FACE.
-LET'S TRY SOMETHING HARDER.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.400
Listen up.

15:51.480 --> 15:53.240
I will give you guys some homework.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.920
Even though the director is nasty,

16:01.800 --> 16:03.200
you have to admit

16:03.880 --> 16:05.280
that he has good taste.

16:09.640 --> 16:11.440
There are security cameras everywhere.

16:12.920 --> 16:14.000
You know that

16:14.680 --> 16:16.160
everyone and everything

16:16.920 --> 16:18.720
has a weakness, right?

16:20.600 --> 16:21.800
Look.

16:22.280 --> 16:24.520
Look at the footage
from the security cameras here.

16:25.920 --> 16:26.920
How did you do that?

16:27.600 --> 16:28.960
I just put in the password.

16:30.680 --> 16:32.360
-How do you know the password?
-Listen.

16:32.440 --> 16:33.800
Magicians

16:34.160 --> 16:36.320
never reveal their secrets.

16:37.640 --> 16:38.480
Here.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.600
That camera

16:41.600 --> 16:43.240
only covers up to here.

16:43.680 --> 16:44.920
And this camera

16:46.160 --> 16:47.800
only goes to somewhere over there.

16:49.080 --> 16:50.480
Therefore,

16:50.880 --> 16:53.000
the blind spot is...

17:00.200 --> 17:01.840
It's unbelievable that the director

17:02.520 --> 17:05.240
paid hundreds of thousands
for this painting in an auction.

17:21.760 --> 17:22.839
People

17:23.400 --> 17:25.000
pay more attention

17:25.079 --> 17:26.319
to quantity than detail.

17:28.520 --> 17:29.960
You gave him so many flowers.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.720
Announcement.

17:36.800 --> 17:40.200
A painting has been stolen
from the art exhibition.

17:40.280 --> 17:44.040
Teachers, please check your
students' belongings immediately.

17:44.840 --> 17:46.040
All right, everyone.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.480
Put your bags

17:49.680 --> 17:52.240
and your hands on the table.

18:06.240 --> 18:07.520
It was you, wasn't it?

18:25.280 --> 18:26.680
Helping your friend hide something

18:27.240 --> 18:28.680
is an offense.

18:45.480 --> 18:46.520
Isn't it beautiful?

18:47.440 --> 18:48.440
No.

18:49.440 --> 18:50.840
I hate flowers.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.200
What sort of stuff do you steal?

19:10.280 --> 19:11.600
Does this camera still work?

19:17.120 --> 19:19.760
Doesn't this cat belong to
the antique store's owner?

19:19.840 --> 19:22.000
It's my cat now.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.600
These glasses...

19:24.680 --> 19:28.160
Audrey Hepburn wore them
in Breakfast at Tiffany's.

19:28.480 --> 19:31.480
I got that one
from a music store in Europe.

19:33.320 --> 19:36.480
Don't tell me
that it's Charlie Chaplin's hat.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.160
This is limited edition.

19:44.760 --> 19:47.320
It goes on eBay
for tens of thousands of baht.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.400
Amazing.

19:51.960 --> 19:53.120
How about this diamond?

19:55.360 --> 19:57.640
That belonged to the wife
of the director at my last school.

20:02.080 --> 20:04.160
Do you have a warehouse
for your stolen goods?

20:04.480 --> 20:05.360
Yes.

20:05.760 --> 20:07.360
I stole that warehouse, too.

20:09.280 --> 20:10.280
I'm kidding.

20:12.120 --> 20:14.760
How about you?
Where do you keep the stuff you steal?

20:32.400 --> 20:33.680
Isn't anybody home?

20:57.880 --> 20:59.520
You have a lot as well.

21:00.360 --> 21:01.800
You're something special.

21:02.640 --> 21:03.520
Oh, please.

21:03.920 --> 21:05.360
Your things fill a warehouse.

21:05.440 --> 21:06.440
Who is this?

21:08.600 --> 21:09.480
My father.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.160
Is he...

21:12.000 --> 21:13.040
He's alive.

21:14.040 --> 21:14.960
But...

21:16.400 --> 21:18.720
he might as well be dead.
We don't really see each other.

21:21.800 --> 21:22.880
By the way,

21:25.320 --> 21:26.640
why do you steal?

21:28.000 --> 21:29.360
No reason.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.680
It's fun.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.440
I like to win.

21:35.160 --> 21:36.800
Do you steal anything in particular?

21:38.120 --> 21:39.320
No.

21:40.280 --> 21:43.640
I go for the things that people say
are hard to steal.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.040
How about you?

21:51.680 --> 21:53.800
I do it for fun.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.440
Liar.

21:58.200 --> 21:59.800
In order to become a better thief,

22:00.840 --> 22:02.200
you must be a better liar.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.320
What do you mean?

22:14.120 --> 22:15.120
Nanno.

22:17.160 --> 22:21.160
Everyone is saying it was a genius thief
who stole the painting.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.400
How was it genius?

22:23.880 --> 22:26.720
I only looked for the blind spot
of the cameras.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.640
Thank you so much.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.360
For what?

22:41.600 --> 22:44.160
For being my friend.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.040
Friend?

22:51.560 --> 22:52.640
Yes.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.720
I've...

22:53.800 --> 22:55.720
never had a friend before.

22:57.520 --> 23:00.000
I had no one at all actually.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.480
To be honest...

23:15.560 --> 23:16.960
Can you do me a favor?

23:21.280 --> 23:22.840
Can you not disappear on me?

23:27.360 --> 23:29.200
What makes you think
that I will disappear?

23:30.880 --> 23:31.880
I...

23:32.400 --> 23:33.560
I don't know.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.440
I just have a feeling

23:36.240 --> 23:38.440
that you will disappear

23:39.040 --> 23:40.760
once you've had your fun

23:41.680 --> 23:43.440
or once you are satisfied.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.920
I really like

23:51.280 --> 23:52.680
being with you.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.680
Please don't disappear on me.

24:02.160 --> 24:03.120
Okay.

24:05.840 --> 24:06.840
Promise me?

24:11.280 --> 24:13.160
We don't have to make any promises.

24:15.160 --> 24:16.720
I'm here right now.

24:18.120 --> 24:20.600
I'm not going anywhere.

24:27.720 --> 24:28.720
Promises

24:29.280 --> 24:30.640
don't have to be kept.

24:32.040 --> 24:33.840
They are there to make us feel better.

24:37.440 --> 24:38.760
To be honest,

24:39.200 --> 24:40.920
it is kind of fun

24:42.400 --> 24:43.480
being

24:45.280 --> 24:46.600
with you.

24:49.960 --> 24:51.320
But...

24:51.880 --> 24:52.960
But what?

24:53.640 --> 24:55.280
Can you let go of my hand now?

24:56.760 --> 24:57.760
Right.

25:12.840 --> 25:15.000
I can bring your father back, TK.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.120
In the past,

25:23.160 --> 25:24.880
I usually steal small things.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.680
Shall we go
for something bigger this time?

25:31.040 --> 25:32.520
What do you mean?

25:35.200 --> 25:38.120
Every year, new students

25:38.200 --> 25:39.960
enroll in our school,

25:40.480 --> 25:41.760
and just like with you,

25:41.840 --> 25:46.360
it's not easy to get into this school.

25:46.440 --> 25:49.800
Please help us out, Director.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.520
Isn't it a good thing?

25:52.600 --> 25:55.400
The director can use the money
to make improvements to the school.

25:55.960 --> 25:57.720
Think about it.

25:58.280 --> 25:59.760
Since you moved here,

26:00.560 --> 26:02.400
has anything been improved

26:02.480 --> 26:06.000
or changed for the better

26:06.560 --> 26:07.960
apart from the director

26:08.360 --> 26:11.160
who gets fatter, and fatter,

26:12.160 --> 26:13.320
and fatter?

26:14.520 --> 26:16.640
Are you planning to steal
the director's money?

26:17.320 --> 26:19.320
It's not his money.

26:20.000 --> 26:23.280
It's the money he stole from the students.

26:27.040 --> 26:28.400
What's your plan?

26:30.000 --> 26:31.720
In the director's office,

26:32.800 --> 26:34.800
there is a big poster behind his desk.

26:35.440 --> 26:36.600
Behind that poster,

26:36.960 --> 26:38.480
there is a hidden safe.

26:38.560 --> 26:40.800
However, this plan will only be successful

26:40.880 --> 26:42.240
if we know

26:43.040 --> 26:44.520
how to break into the safe.

27:03.920 --> 27:06.160
The police have been following me all day.

27:12.760 --> 27:14.400
Shall we abort the plan?

27:16.560 --> 27:18.560
Our plan is very well-prepared.

27:21.880 --> 27:23.400
But if we get caught,

27:24.440 --> 27:26.040
we will be in big trouble, Nanno.

27:28.040 --> 27:28.960
So, what then?

27:35.160 --> 27:36.160
It's fine.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.440
I can do it alone.

27:53.080 --> 27:55.680
-Hang on, Nanno.
-Why are you following me?

27:56.880 --> 27:58.400
We are not going with the plan anymore.

28:00.680 --> 28:03.440
I'm backing out of this for you.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.760
I don't want you to get caught.

28:07.080 --> 28:09.560
I'm not scared. You can't stop me.

28:09.640 --> 28:10.800
Wait.

28:13.800 --> 28:15.120
I will do it

28:16.760 --> 28:18.320
on one condition.

28:20.800 --> 28:21.960
If you get caught,

28:23.840 --> 28:25.480
blame it on me.

28:26.640 --> 28:27.960
Tell them I tricked you into it.

28:31.760 --> 28:33.400
-You...
-Do we have a deal?

28:37.920 --> 28:39.520
How about our promise

28:39.600 --> 28:40.920
to not disappear on each other?

28:46.400 --> 28:48.000
If this is about our promise...

28:52.080 --> 28:53.720
I will break it for you.

28:59.920 --> 29:01.160
Can you promise me?

29:03.240 --> 29:04.360
Promise me, okay?

29:06.880 --> 29:08.000
Can you?

29:18.200 --> 29:19.960
We will go with the original plan tonight.

30:08.040 --> 30:09.360
I'm ready, Nanno.

30:11.920 --> 30:13.640
Are you sure that you want to go in alone?

30:15.520 --> 30:16.600
I'm sure.

30:17.480 --> 30:18.600
You can start.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.200
All right. You can go in now.

30:49.560 --> 30:50.840
I found the safe, Nanno.

30:51.680 --> 30:53.920
-Keep an eye out, Nanno.
-I know.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.480
I found the documents, Nanno.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.240
Wait a moment, officer.

32:00.320 --> 32:02.120
Let me talk to the kid in private first.

32:02.800 --> 32:04.760
-Sure, Director. Go ahead.
-Thank you.

32:04.840 --> 32:06.200
Let's go, everyone.

32:17.080 --> 32:18.560
As for what happened,

32:19.400 --> 32:20.520
usually,

32:21.320 --> 32:22.720
there's a way to settle it.

32:24.440 --> 32:27.720
Your father probably knows
how to handle this.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.840
I've already informed him.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.440
This time,

32:47.520 --> 32:50.000
you can't steal my father's money.

32:51.560 --> 32:53.640
Even though I didn't get the documents,

32:55.560 --> 32:58.040
I have the footage from all of your
security cameras as evidence.

32:59.280 --> 33:01.160
Imagine if it got out.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.600
She had nothing to do with this.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.960
Actually,

33:09.760 --> 33:11.160
she has everything to do with it.

33:11.240 --> 33:12.240
Isn't that right?

33:17.440 --> 33:19.360
All the footage was saved

33:20.160 --> 33:21.640
on this computer.

33:28.440 --> 33:29.320
She deserves

33:30.080 --> 33:31.720
to be a student at our school.

33:36.720 --> 33:39.320
Director, there is a parent here
to see you.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.400
Let him in.

33:43.360 --> 33:45.840
I can bring your father back, TK.

33:58.640 --> 33:59.680
We heard

34:01.680 --> 34:03.320
that there was some unruly behavior.

34:04.680 --> 34:07.360
So, my boss sent a small gift

34:08.320 --> 34:10.239
in exchange for you
to forget about everything.

34:13.679 --> 34:15.280
He also said

34:16.560 --> 34:17.679
that he will cover the cost

34:18.880 --> 34:20.840
of any damages you have incurred.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.880
NARUECHIT LAORSRI

34:31.600 --> 34:32.960
Tell my father

34:34.159 --> 34:35.159
that money

34:36.440 --> 34:37.639
can't buy everything.

34:41.880 --> 34:44.400
-We probably won't see each other again.
-Don't do that, boy.

34:45.320 --> 34:47.239
Don't do that, sir!

34:49.120 --> 34:50.719
-Sir, please calm down.
-Hello there.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.840
-Director.
-Officers, take him away.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.440
YOUTH DETENTION CENTER

36:22.400 --> 36:24.360
Now that you're out,
don't come back here again.

36:51.720 --> 36:54.320
Are you that surprised
to see your own father?

36:57.440 --> 36:58.440
Why are you here?

37:00.880 --> 37:02.600
You're mean, just like your mother.

37:05.640 --> 37:07.120
I don't want to see you.

37:08.120 --> 37:09.840
I don't want your money.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.160
I can survive on my own.

37:14.280 --> 37:15.160
All right.

37:16.400 --> 37:18.120
I just stopped by. I'll leave soon.

37:19.000 --> 37:21.600
I just wanted to make sure
that you would be okay on your own.

37:39.280 --> 37:40.680
Take care, son.

37:57.760 --> 37:58.760
Father.

38:01.200 --> 38:02.360
Father.

39:48.120 --> 39:49.240
People

39:50.360 --> 39:52.240
don't appreciate what they have

39:53.840 --> 39:55.600
until it's gone.

39:59.840 --> 40:02.400
When I said that I could bring
your father back,

40:03.560 --> 40:06.200
I saw that it was necessary
to take you away from your father first.

